er-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"disablevirtualstick close the virtual stick mode.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">disableVirtualStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Close the virtual stick mode.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getleftstick to get the left stick instance of the virtual stick.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getLeftStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To get the left stick instance of the virtual stick.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getrightstick to get the right stick instance of the virtual stick.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getRightStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To get the right stick instance of the virtual stick.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled enable virtual stick advanced mode.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Enable virtual stick advanced mode.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"sendvirtualstickadvancedparam send virtual stick advanced control parameters.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Send virtual stick advanced control parameters.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setvirtualstickstatelistener to set the listener of the virtual stick status.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setVirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To set the listener of the virtual stick status.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"enum\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Enum</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">2</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_enum_flightcontrolauthority_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"flightcontrolauthority flight control authority.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">FlightControlAuthority</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Flight control authority.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_enum_flightcontrolauthoritychangereason_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"flightcontrolauthoritychangereason flight control authority change reason.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">FlightControlAuthorityChangeReason</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Flight control authority change reason.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"class\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Class</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">4</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"istick virtual stick class.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">IStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Virtual stick class.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickstatelistener_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"virtualstickstatelistener listener of the virtual stick status.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">VirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Listener of the virtual stick status.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_virtualstickflightcontrolparam_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"virtualstickflightcontrolparam virtual stick advanced control parameters.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">VirtualStickFlightControlParam</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Virtual stick advanced control parameters.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickstate_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"virtualstickstate listener of the virtual stick status.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">VirtualStickState</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Listener of the virtual stick status.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_enablevirtualstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_enablevirtualstick_inline\">enableVirtualStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_enablevirtualstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>enableVirtualStick</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">enableVirtualStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Open the virtual stick mode. <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>Note</strong><br><br> 1. For flight safety, when the aircraft is close(about 30 meters) to the restricted flight zone or restricted distance, the remote controller will get the control of the aircraft, and the virtual stick cannot be used.<br> 2. The virtual stick normal mode supports obstacle avoidance by default. <br> 3. In the virtual stick advanced mode, obstacle avoidance is supported only when the vertical control Mode is velocity mode, the  yaw control mode is angular velocity mode, and the roll pitch control mode is velocity mode.<br> 4. Currently, only M300 RTK, M350 RTK, M30 series, Mavic 3E series and Mavic 3M aircraft support obstacle avoidance in virtual joystick mode. <br> 5. For aircraft models Mavic 3E series, and Mavic 3M, if the firmware version is below V7.01.10.03, obstacle sensing will be disabled when virtual stick mode is activated. We recommend updating the aircraft to the latest firmware version for optimal functionality.<br></font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>Return the callback of execution result.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick_inline\">disableVirtualStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>disableVirtualStick</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">disableVirtualStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Close the virtual stick mode.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>Return the callback of execution result.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick_inline\">getLeftStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getLeftStick</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IStick</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getLeftStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To get the left stick instance of the virtual stick. Left stick controls the yaw axis and throttle of the aircraft.</font></p><ul><font color=\"#666\"> <li>When the stick moves left, the horizontalPosition is negative. The aircraft will rotate counterclockwise when looking down at the aircraft. </li> <li>When the stick moves right, the horizontalPosition is positive. The aircraft will rotate clockwise when looking down at the aircraft.</li> <li>When the stick moves upward, the verticalPosition is positive. The aircraft will increase its altitude.</li> <li>When the stick moves downward, the verticalPosition is negative. The aircraft will lower its altitude.</li> </font></ul><font color=\"#666\"> <br><br><code><i>Supported since MSDK 5.0.0</i></code><p></p>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_DJIStick.html#ivirtualstickmanager_djistick\">IStick</a></font></code></td><td>Return the instance of left stick.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick_inline\">getRightStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getRightStick</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IStick</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getRightStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To get the right stick instance of the virtual stick. Right stick controls the roll axis and pitch axis of the aircraft.</font></p><ul><font color=\"#666\"> <li>When the stick moves left, the horizontalPosition is negative. The aircraft will fly left when looking down at the aircraft.</li> <li>When the stick moves right, the horizontalPosition is positive. The aircraft will fly right when looking down at the aircraft.</li> <li>When the stick moves upward, the verticalPosition is positive. The aircraft will fly forward when looking down at the aircraft.</li> <li>When the stick moves downward, the verticalPosition is negative. The aircraft will fly backward when looking down at the aircraft.</li> </font></ul><font color=\"#666\"> <br><br><code><i>Supported since MSDK 5.0.0</i></code><p></p>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_DJIStick.html#ivirtualstickmanager_djistick\">IStick</a></font></code></td><td>Return the instance of right stick.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled_inline\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">isEnabled</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Enable virtual stick advanced mode. In advanced mode, the control data of left stick <code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick\">getLeftStick</a></code> and right stick <code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick\">getLeftStick</a></code> will no longer take effect, you can call <code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</a></code> to set more advanced control parameters for use with more complex application scenarios, such as using a virtual stick to implement waypoint-related functions.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>isEnabled</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true means enable virtual stick advanced mode.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam_inline\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickFlightControlParam</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">param</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Send virtual stick advanced control parameters.</font></p><li><font color=\"#666\">Please call <code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</a></code> to enable advanced mode before using this interface. </font></li><font color=\"#666\"> <li>Developers can send control parameters at a specific frequency according to their own needs. The recommended sending frequency is between 5Hz and 25Hz. </li> <li>For detailed usage of advanced control parameters, please refer to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com/doc/mobile-sdk-tutorial/en/basic-introduction/basic-concepts/flight-controller.html#virtual-sticks\">Virtual stick</a></li> <li>For advanced control parameter ranges, please refer to: <code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_VirtualStickRange.html#ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickrange\">VirtualStickRange</a></code>.</li> <br><br><code><i>Supported since MSDK 5.1.0</i></code><p></p>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>param</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"Value_FlightController_Struct_VirtualStickFlightControlParam.html#value_flightcontroller_struct_virtualstickflightcontrolparam\"><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickFlightControlParam</span></a> </code></span></td><td>Advanced mode parameters.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\">setVirtualStickStateListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setVirtualStickStateListener</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setVirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickStateListener</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">listener</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To set the listener of the virtual stick status.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>listener</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_VirtualStickStateListener.html#ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickstatelistener\"><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickStateListener</span></a> </code></span></td><td>Listener of the virtual stick status</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_removevirtualstickstatelistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></